    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσμ-ώτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prisoner, captive,</i>
